msgstr ""
"Неверное значение I<clockid>. (Значение B<CLOCK_THREAD_CPUTIME_ID> нельзя "
"указать в I<clockid>.)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<ENOTSUP>"
